        <details key="documentation" value="This value indicates the data type of the result:VT_NULL= 1 indicates a null value.VT_I2= 2 indicates a 2-byte integer.VT_I4= 3 indicates a 4-byte integer.T_R4= 4 indicates a 4-byte real.VT_R8= 5 indicates an 8-byte real.VT_CY= 6 indicates a currency.VT_DATE= 7 indicates a date.VT_BSTR= 8 indicates a binary string.VT_BOOL= 11 indicates a Boolean."/>
